dalf.py` reads `SKILL.md` from `ANCHOR_GANDALF_SKILL_DIR` (default `C:\\Dev\\Skill Foundry\\skills\\gandalf`), builds prompt = protocol + \"analyze project at `<folder>`, emit ONLY the schema JSON as final message\", invoked through `ANCHOR_RUNNER_CMD` (prod `claude -p`; tests `tests/stub_gandalf.py`).\n- (2) Input = point Gandalf at the project **folder** with `cwd=<folder>` AND `--add-dir <folder>` (resolves MAJOR S1-5), under a Gandalf-specific injectable timeout `ANCHOR_GANDALF_TIMEOUT` (default ~600s, NOT summarizer's 60s); timeout â†’ honest degraded run, never a hang.\n- (3) Output = full run artifacts at **project root** `<folder>/gandalf/run-<ts>/`: `report.md`, `exec-summary.md` (served by existing `/artifact` route â€” never under `.anchor`, which `/artifact` rejects), plus `advisor-output.json` (audit truth); internal index at `.anchor/projects/<id>/gandalf/index.json` (read directly, never served). `gandalf/` added to project `.gitignore` (best-effort); one-line verdict = cleaned top-level `verdict` field stored in index (resolves BLOCKER A).\n- (4) Cadence = first scan + manual; new `_trigger_gandalf` mirrors `_trigger_project_summary` exactly (checks `_PROACTIVE_SUMMARY_ENABLED`, snapshots/forwards runner env, daemon thread, non-blocking â€” resolves MAJOR S1-4). First-run-only via `run_gandalf_if_absent` guarded by a per-project in-process lock (check-and-set before scheduling, resolves MAJOR S3-4 TOCTOU) + skip-if-running; manual `POST /api/rnd/gandalf_run` is NOT module-flag-gated.\n- (5) UI = right-column \"Gandalf\" tab **above Grass** (order Gandalf â†’ Grass â†’ Deliverables); newest-first history rows (verdict + timestamp + degraded/cross_model chip), click expands exec-summary inline (cockpit accordion, not page bounce), `[Full report]`/`[raw JSON]` via `/artifact`; honest degraded/error rows + empty state; white-wizard SVG `vendor/brand/gandalf-white-icon.svg` (added to `dist_manifest.txt`).\n- (6) Re-runnable any time; each run a new timestamped entry, history accumulates newest-first.\n\n**Architecture (extend, do not fork)**\n- New `gandalf.py` (stdlib only, in manifest): `run_gandalf(...)` builds prompt â†’ `job_runner.launch[_guarded]` â†’ `extract_assistant_text` â†’ locate last balanced top-level JSON â†’ validate schema contract (9 required top-level keys + per-item keys, resolves MAJOR S3-3) â†’ render artifacts â†’ append SAFE index record under `paths.WRITE_LOCK`, always stamped `degraded:true`; failures recorded as honest error runs, never raised. Plus `run_gandalf_if_absent`, `list_runs` (newest-first SAFE projections, no absolute paths), `get_run`, render helpers, and `GANDALF_INDEX_SCHEMA_VERSION` normalization (resolves minor S3-8).\n- `anchor_gui.py` extensions: `POST /api/rnd/gandalf_run`, `GET /api/rnd/gandalf`, `_trigger_gandalf` + first-scan hook in rescan block, `_render_layoutd_gandalf_panel` before `{grass_panel}`, the vendored SVG route. Reuses `job_runner`, `report_viewer`/`/artifact`, `paths.WRITE_LOCK`, `summarizer.short_summary_text` unchanged.\n- PROJECT-DONE wave: `anchor.py rnd gandalf <pid>` (read-only mirror, no mutating CLI form), `anchor_healthcheck.check_gandalf_surface` (fully stubbed, registered after `check_rnd_v12_surface`, never binds `:8777`), distro manifest + import scan green, CLAUDE.md/SESSION-HANDOFF.md updates, and a documented manual live-smoke (one real `claude -p` run must emit parseable schema â€” not a pytest gate; resolves prod half of BLOCKER B).\n\n**Constraints & risks**\n- Hard constraints carried: stdlib-only (lone lazy `pywinpty` waiver), hermetic stubbed tests (never real claude/data/network/`:8777`/real Skill-Foundry skill), Playwright DEV-only, f-string/RAW-JS rules, and the non-negotiable UI-wave GREEN bar (rendered-DOM pos+neg + Playwright/Chromium + screenshot vs mockup + John's sign-off; no merge/`nssm restart` until sign-off).\n- Risks mitigated R1â€“R7: schema fragility â†’ honest error run; first-scan cost â†’ first-run-only + daemo